class SendShipmentNotification
{
    public function __construct(private NotificationDispatcher $dispatcher) {}

    public function handle(ShipmentCreated $event): void
    {
        $order = $event->shipment->order;

        $this->dispatcher->dispatch(
            $order->customer,                         // must be Notifiable
            new OrderShippedNotification($event->shipment) // email notification
        );
    }
}
```

**Differences from the ticket that you should be aware of:**
